  "stageId": "act18d3_07",
  "title": "守護者",
  "storyCode": "SV-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "270b3e18bcd18d3d7f202e5bc86c593006a35b24629080e6c182307a76a383e7",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "鱗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "......殼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "能吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "能吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "多一點，再多一點......塞滿嘴巴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "漏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "撿起來，吞下去。更多一點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "帶走。帶回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "帶回去。塞滿身體。塞到塞不下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "教士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "教士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "兄弟姐妹們，盡情享受你們的早餐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "這是對善行的獎賞，只因饑渴與病痛並未擊潰我們，而是令我們更加真摯，更加團結，更加友愛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "這種長篇大論的表演，從一個城市到另一個城市，你竟不覺得膩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "何為表演？將祂的偉岸與仁愛帶到陸上，令無知者領受，我本就樂意之至。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "他們什麼都聽不懂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我們的海洋將一視同仁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "來吧，兄弟，將你手上這塊鱗肉分享給你受苦的兄弟。你要相信，捨下這一小塊，他的滿足會使得你的心靈更加滿足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民C",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "而你，你應和你的兄弟道謝，感激他捨下他本可以擁有的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你倆站在一起，手握著手，足抵著足，共用彼此的性命，自此你們將更偉大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男性居民D",
      "text": "謝......教士......老爺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "乖孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "約定並不在你與它之間。而是他們和它，經你的手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "約定？不，約定是雙向的，這些受苦的人還不足以令大海有所求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "他們請求，大海給予回應。而我幫助他們，令他們的聲音能被聽見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你既然已將自己當作我們的一部分，你自然清楚規則。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "請原諒我的生疏。我可以換上更貼切的措辭——你將他們的血肉築成通路，從而在教會內部獲得你想要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "無論怎麼說，你沒必要每次現身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你怎知我要什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "高人一等的快感很容易使人沉溺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "謬誤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "身為海最虔心的造物，我的地位並非偽妄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我站在這裡，只是因我發自真心想救他們。若是沒有我，他們早就化成了這陸上的一灘灘骯髒腐肉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "疾病，饑餓，這些具體的敵人，如果還能對抗，便不是最深的苦難。最深的苦難來自人心靈的深處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "當人們發現災難已無法對抗，他們無論做什麼都將把自己引向不可避免的衰亡，這才是真正苦難到來之時。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "像這樣的城鎮，伊比利亞還有多少？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "這片龐大的國土早已支撐不起人們對它的訴求，這裡的人與人卻依舊困縮在各自逼仄的皮囊內，或彼此隔絕，或互相爭鬥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "您對伊比利亞的關心令人讚歎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你又錯了。我在意人們的苦，而非區區陸上的國境線。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "人都是如此，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "囿於自身肉體的限制，難以憑自己的力量打開對自我和對族類的執著，一味地選擇對抗而非理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "這樣下去，再強大的個體都免不了被逐個擊破，苦難終將吞噬每一個角落。你也曾見證，你也曾動搖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "對我說這些，真的有必要？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "或許我說的還不夠多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "真知總是值得傳述，無論聽者是否愚鈍如你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "又或者，看在這段時間的共事之情份上，不如將這段話作為消磨等待時間的小小娛樂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "您的言語技巧的確非同凡響。難怪沉迷的人這麼多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你仍然無法理解。我比真誠更真誠。我對他們並無訴求，我亦不相信強迫的力量，我只想向他們指出一種新的可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "身體的弱小將永遠限制他們的認知。你以為我是在通過言語誘使他們心靈信服，恰恰相反。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我是在令他們的心靈聽從身體最基本的訴求。聖人的訓導能帶來的不過是一時的盲信，肉身的強大才能令他們有資格親眼看見更多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "海裡有些生物。它們沒有眼睛，身體微小，無法游動，只能隨著潮汐漂蕩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "它們見到的大海，與我們見到的有多大區別？沒有眼睛的生物又何從領會大海的神聖與深邃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你與你的同僚，你們不知從何處謀取了這層卑劣卻堅硬的皮囊。你們看不見這些弱小的正如何掙扎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "試問誰才是真正的傲慢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "是正在幫助他們的我，還是那些借著危難擴張，利用言語、將真正的絕望替換成虛假的希望，欺瞞、控制悲慘弱者，從而盜取權柄的偽神教徒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "又或者——是從來不願意正視海底的愚蠢的你們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我將我看見的分享予他們，令他們打開視野，知曉自己仍有真實的希望。他們自己選擇，是同陸地一起衰朽，還是隨大海走向新生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "這種可能性將不僅能將他們從饑餓病痛的絕境中解救，同樣也是大海對僵持著耗損著的陸地的慷慨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "這並非征服，而是理解，是容納。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "我向他們指出了路，帶給他們好的生活，最終引他們如我一樣走向真理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "這便是我偉大的事業。你錯誤的皮囊困住了你的心靈，令你短視，看不見真正的偉大。我將原諒你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "呵。或許沉迷的不止有他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呼，歌手，我們差點來晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "好多吃的......大家都好餓，總算有吃的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "一、二、三......這些，帶回去，弄碎了，煮湯給佩特拉奶奶喝。今晚喝這個，好不好啊，小長凳？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "嗚......嗷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "不，不要直接吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "殼太硬了，會把你的牙弄壞。回去煮軟了再吃呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你也拿一些？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌、歌手？你還愣著幹什麼呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "吃慢些，兄弟，這些都是你的。往前看，這一整片，也終將都是你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "來吧，打開心靈，接受自己，擁抱他人，學會相信，懂得犧牲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "紛爭早已終結，苦難也會遠去。我們站在一起，我們的心靈、肉體與信仰都將愈發強韌，就如我們足下這片永恆的海洋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "請容許我走遠些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我對近日某些......飲食消化不良。我或許會忍耐不住，吐在你臉上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "——兄弟，你的貝殼掉了，讓你的兄弟替你拿著吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "真有趣。你今天心情不錯。你甚至對我使用了這樣的詞句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "隨你怎麼說，請便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "來自大海的訊息令你振奮。你等不及我們的盛會了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "那就去吧，去尋她。找到你的故交，將這份喜悅分享予她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......找到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你幹什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "噓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "過來。你看他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你聞到了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你的姿勢不夠優美。我教你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我和你跳過幾次舞，斯卡蒂？兩次，還是三次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你是個好舞伴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你很關心她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "不然呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "她現在還算安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "證據。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你需要那些無用的東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我真懷疑陸上的日子磨壞了你的鼻子，獵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你身上全是臭味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我比你更想吐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她確實和你在一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "看來你的鼻子還不算太壞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "幸好，你還沒像一個哭哭啼啼的陸生幼崽一樣，纏著我問個不停，問我為什麼要帶走她，又為什麼在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "問問題從來不是我們的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我們？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不知道你還是不是我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "看來你的心裡還是有許多疑問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "（摸箱子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "不確定的話，還是不要動手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "否則，你就只是在給敵人機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我的目標不是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "那你來這裡，是想做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你明明知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你一直想找她。找到她，你的疑問就能消失嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她的記憶壞了。她並不能告訴我什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "瞧瞧你的模樣。也就比困在籠子裡的好上那麼一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "讓我再教你一些，雖然你不是我的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "記住，獵人追逐獵物，而不是沉迷追逐本身。盲目的追逐只能帶來心理安慰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你已經軟弱到渴望這些虛無的幻覺了嗎，斯卡蒂？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你多久沒跳舞了？你走的路太多，你的皮膚很乾燥。你也許已經遺忘了呼吸的節奏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我再問你一次。你來這裡，是來做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你不動手？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你們不是一起的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我沒那麼在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "在乎的是你。是你要解開心結，不是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你在和我裝神弄鬼？他是什麼人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我說了你就會信嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "居民",
      "text": "呃......呃呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "慢慢來，別摔倒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "聽到了嗎？這海浪的身影。噗通，噗通，噗通，就像你我的心跳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "你們食的、飲的皆是大海的饋贈。兄弟，你是否感覺到充沛的力量，正從口腹湧來，流通手腳，抵達心臟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "text": "擁抱你們面前的浩瀚吧！這是新生的希望！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦，歌手呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "一眨眼，她又不見了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "算了。歌手認得路，她可能又去找她的同伴了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我們走吧，長凳，帶上這些吃的，回家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "嗚啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "長凳，我好想唱歌。我們唱歌吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手唱的歌。你還記得嗎？你記得也沒用。你連話都還不會說。這樣吧，我唱給你聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "他的家鄉在後♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "咿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "他的路在身前♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幼年居民",
      "text": "咿......呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "別撓我。唉。你覺得難聽對不對？我也覺得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我比歌手差遠啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "但是，多唱幾次，我也會唱好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哼哼......他的路在身前......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "我要走了。再不走他會起疑心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "二隊長！你到底在盤算什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你是不是需要隊友？你需要隊友的話，為什麼不說？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "要嘛你是敵人？如果你是敵人，剛才我想用貝殼了結你的時候，你為什麼沒有反過來殺了我？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "text": "你先弄清楚自己要什麼。彷徨的獵人連陷阱都辨別不出。不明不白地成為別人的收獲，這是你想要的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你的眼神，好像有點變了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你之前看我們的時候，和看那些海裡來的怪物，都沒什麼區別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "但現在，你願意教我做海藻酒，還願意為我們唱歌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......你們和怪物，當然不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怪物才不會纏著要我唱歌。怪物連說話都不會。它們通常又髒又蠢，只知道進食。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "那......那些海裡的怪物，它們會吃了我們嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "如果它們餓的話，會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "它們爬上來，就和我們去海裡一樣，都是為了找吃的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你同情怪物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "餓著肚子，確實難受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "給它們吃掉的人就不會這麼想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "是......我也不想就這樣被怪物吃掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "以前我沒想過。現在，呃，我還想......再多聽歌手唱一會歌。我還要教小長凳唱，就像佩特拉奶奶教會我的那麼多事一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那你可得和你奶奶一樣，活久一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "嗯！至少現在，我一點都不擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "因為......歌手，你還在這裡，你會幫我們，砰砰砰把它們都打跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......我的心跳，在加快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哎。對。是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......我畢竟還是個獵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
